      "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nLGTM. No findings in this light review. I checked all three changed files and the affected NCCL-EP grouped-tensor path. The BF16 regression test exercises the removed restriction, and the restored tests cover output/gradient parity and padding. I reviewed source only; I didn't run the GPU tests.\n\n> **Note:** formal approval is not available for this request, so this review is posted as a comment only.\n\n*Review generated by codex. This was a full review. Request a full review with `/review reset=true`.*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:a518cd4116eb1ba43f226bdbda2b1fbd8ba356b662ecb85711ebcc2e35180ea9:903ebf8cda9072bc7805ed8e5c91b10098b9fb18c4737ea82b44703b5f6a4025 -->",
